# lang-ruby — Ruby developer toolchain (FETCHED-ONLINE, never baked). The Ruby
# runtime is opt-in and mise-managed (the `mise:ruby` directive), matching the
# "bake no language runtimes" stance (PROPOSAL §7/§13). No pacman members — mise
# delivers the interpreter under its user-owned ~/.config/mise + data dir, so a
# `iictl pack remove lang-ruby` cleanly undoes the directive and leaves nothing
# baked behind.
#meta:type lang
mise:ruby
